          "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Supporting hospital fall prevention strategies through smart, connected bed and stretcher workflows</span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Discover how one hospital reduced bed-related falls by 64.8%, and an adult ED in a level 1 trauma center decreased falls 27% using Stryker's smart, connected beds and stretchers.<sup>1,2*</sup> Learn more about the solutions behind the results. Find out how we can help your team use a data-driven approach to supporting fall-prevention protocols and long-term success.</span></span></p>\n",
